\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The founder-departure authority-diffusion construct: in the 6-12 month window before a founder-only Truck-Factor-Detachment-Departure (TFDD) event, authority over the codebase either stays concentrated with the founder (low diffusion, left) or spreads to other DOA-recognized file owners (high diffusion, right). At-TFDD snapshot covariates (developer count, commits, files) are measured at the moment of TFDD; the pre-departure covariates (founder commit-share, count of distinct non-founder owners) are measured strictly before it to avoid post-departure leakage.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:fig1}{{1}{3}{The founder-departure authority-diffusion construct: in the 6-12 month window before a founder-only Truck-Factor-Detachment-Departure (TFDD) event, authority over the codebase either stays concentrated with the founder (low diffusion, left) or spreads to other DOA-recognized file owners (high diffusion, right). At-TFDD snapshot covariates (developer count, commits, files) are measured at the moment of TFDD; the pre-departure covariates (founder commit-share, count of distinct non-founder owners) are measured strictly before it to avoid post-departure leakage}{figure.1}{}}
